      answer: "C",
      solution: "<div class=\"sol-idea\">看到集合里装着三角式 → <b>先把每个值算出来</b>，再做集合运算。</div><div class=\"sol-step\"><span class=\"no\">①</span>用<span class=\"term\">诱导公式<span class=\"term-pop\"><b>口诀「奇变偶不变，符号看象限」：</b>\\(\\sin\\dfrac{7\\pi}{6}=\\sin\\left(\\pi+\\dfrac{\\pi}{6}\\right)=-\\sin\\dfrac{\\pi}{6}\\)；\\(\\cos\\dfrac{5\\pi}{3}=\\cos\\left(2\\pi-\\dfrac{\\pi}{3}\\right)=\\cos\\dfrac{\\pi}{3}\\)；\\(\\tan\\dfrac{5\\pi}{4}=\\tan\\left(\\pi+\\dfrac{\\pi}{4}\\right)=\\tan\\dfrac{\\pi}{4}\\)。</span></span>逐个求值：\\(\\sin\\dfrac{7\\pi}{6}=-\\dfrac12\\)，\\(\\cos\\dfrac{5\\pi}{3}=\\dfrac12\\)，\\(\\tan\\dfrac{5\\pi}{4}=1\\)，即 \\(A=\\left\\{-\\dfrac12,\\dfrac12,1\\right\\}\\)。</div><div class=\"sol-step\"><span class=\"no\">②</span>取交集：公共元素为 <em class=\"key\">\\(-\\dfrac12\\) 和 \\(1\\)</em>（\\(\\dfrac12\\notin B\\)，\\(-\\dfrac{\\sqrt3}{2}\\notin A\\)），选 <em class=\"key\">C</em>。</div><div class=\"sol-takeaway\">🎒 <b>带走：</b>集合交汇题先「翻译」元素再运算；特殊角三角值要背到条件反射。</div>",
